# Scoped Kubernetes-config exceptions. Each needs a matching, unexpired row in SECURITY-EXCEPTIONS.md
# (enforced by scripts/check-exceptions.py).
#
# EXC-006: the deployment runs the pinned UPSTREAM image from Docker Hub (docker.io/bkimminich/juice-shop),
# which Trivy treats as an untrusted registry. Deliberate for now: we run the official Juice Shop image.
# The trusted-registry control is enforced in Phase 3 (build our own signed image to GHCR + Kyverno
# images-trusted-and-pinned policy). Expires when that lands.
KSV-0125 exp:2027-01-31
#
# EXC-007: readOnlyRootFilesystem not set. Juice Shop writes into its own served app directory
# (frontend/dist, ftp, logs, uploads, data), so a read-only root FS breaks it. NOT required by Pod
# Security "restricted" (Trivy KSV-0014 is stricter). Compensating: non-root, all caps dropped, no
# privilege escalation, seccomp RuntimeDefault. Revisit with scoped emptyDir mounts.
KSV-0014 exp:2027-03-31
